","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Wastes is not a land type. If something asks you to name a land type, you can't choose Wastes.","oracle_id":"05d24b0c-904a-46b6-b42a-96a4d91a0dd4","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Azorius First-Wing doesn’t have protection from creatures that are enchanted.","oracle_id":"08d02fdb-4b3f-4f55-b5fc-6bb4d2a14b1f","published_at":"2006-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect tries to move an Aura onto this creature, the effect will fail and the Aura will stay where it was.","oracle_id":"08d02fdb-4b3f-4f55-b5fc-6bb4d2a14b1f","published_at":"2006-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"“Protection from enchantments” means that Azorius First-Wing can’t be enchanted, it can’t be targeted by Aura spells or by abilities of enchantments, all damage that would be dealt to it by enchantments is prevented, and it can’t be blocked by creatures that are also enchantments.","oracle_id":"08d02fdb-4b3f-4f55-b5fc-6bb4d2a14b1f","published_at":"2006-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can tap any two untapped white and/or blue creatures you control, including ones you haven't controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Sky Hussar's forecast ability. ","oracle_id":"21b41dd6-bff7-4e3d-aa28-551a30194225","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.","oracle_id":"54730a15-0f03-4064-89dc-24de05117e7c","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.","oracle_id":"54730a15-0f03-4064-89dc-24de05117e7c","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.","oracle_id":"54730a15-0f03-4064-89dc-24de05117e7c","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players' turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated \"any time you could cast a sorcery\".","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2010-06-15","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
